<P STYLE="margin: 6pt 0 12pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(f)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</B>The Company has not been treated as, and no facts or circumstances exist that would cause the Company to be treated as a &#8220;publicly
traded partnership&#8221; within the meaning of Section 7704 of the Code for any taxable period ending on or before the Closing Date.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 6pt 0 12pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(g)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</B>If applicable, all severance, production, gross receipts, and ad valorem Taxes imposed with respect to the Well and attributable
