<P STYLE="margin: 6pt 0 12pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(h)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</B>No Seller is a &quot;foreign person&quot; as that term is used in Treasury Regulations Section 1.1445-2.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 6pt 0 12pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</B>No written claim has ever been made by a Governmental Authority in a jurisdiction where the Company does not file Tax Returns that
the Company is or may be subject to Tax by that jurisdiction.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 6pt 0 12pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(j)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</B>The Company has not been audited by the Internal Revenue Service or any other Governmental Authority within five years prior to the
Closing Date, and there is no investigation, audit, assessment or other Tax proceeding pending or proposed or, to Sellers&#8217; knowledge,
